[0.14016373600000226,"o","Candle CLI: Your wallets and agent tools, one command away.\r\n\r\nCLI: scripts and terminals. Agents always pass --json.\r\nMCP: chat agents (Claude, the connector). The same launch fields and results as the CLI's --json.\r\nSDK: code that embeds Candle.\r\n\r\nUsage: candle <command> [<subcommand>] [flags]\r\n       candle help <command> [--more]\r\n\r\nStart here\r\n  setup   One wizard: authorize, fund, connect, verify\r\n  auth    Authorize this device, or show and clear its credentials\r\n  doctor  Diagnose CLI setup: credentials, storage backend, API reachability, security key helper\r\n  tui     The Candle TUI: holdings, the feed, your agents and approval cards, in the terminal\r\n          (preview)\r\n\r\nTrade\r\n  swap      Quote, confirm and swap on Solana or Hood, bridge between them; read an operation by id\r\n"]
